		{"id":"6127dfc6004732a7","type":"text","text":"Features that I want\n- To be able to ask the chat -> prompt questions \n- Animated questions (U don't actually need to ask questions)\n- Backend agent architecutre of my experiences\n\nGraphics:\n- Little Blob mascot \n- Dotted experience with Gradiants but mostly simplistic","x":-1260,"y":-80,"width":347,"height":485},
		{"id":"3b8ac8fea1f248cb","type":"text","text":"## PERSONAL HARDWARE\n\n### The stuff you can't install\n\nThis is personality.\n\nAnd I would make this playful rather than professional.\n\nThings like:\n\n```\nCURRENTLY RUNNING\n\ncuriosity.exe             ██████████ 100%\ntalking_to_strangers      █████████░  92%\nmaking_side_projects      █████████░  88%\nsleep                     ███░░░░░░░  31%\n```\n\nOr:\n\n**Default settings**\n\n- gets obsessed with systems\n- asks too many questions\n- learns by making things\n- likes people who care deeply about weird things\n\n**Background processes**\n\n- current rabbit holes\n- books / papers\n- side projects\n- communities\n- hobbies","x":-1336,"y":-740,"width":423,"height":620},
		{"id":"30ab7eac29e1cf20","type":"file","file":"Screenshot 2026-08-24 at 5.18.56 AM.png","x":3120,"y":1821,"width":365,"height":50}
